{"id":"ed99e845d5c0c4a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Dominant Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy — ZFC Game3 Dominant Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy — ZFC Game3 Dominant Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy — ZFC Game3 Dominant Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-game.md\">../batch02/58-df-game.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> (set of players)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (strategy-set family with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>, writing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j=S(j)\">\\(S_j=S(j)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> (payoff-function family with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>, writing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=u(i)\">\\(u_i=u(i)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\\in S_i\">\\(s_i\\in S_i\\)</span> (candidate strategy)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DominantStrategy}\">\\(\\operatorname{DominantStrategy}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}dominant\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominantStrategy}(s_i,i,N,S,u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(S)=N\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=N\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in N\\;(S_j\\neq\\varnothing\\land u_j\\in\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{k\\in N}S_k})\\bigr)\\land i\\in N\\land s_i\\in S_i\\land\\forall t_i\\in S_i\\;\\forall\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}S_j\\;\\Bigl(u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}dominant\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominantStrategy}(s_i,i,N,S,u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(S)=N\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=N\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in N\\;(S_j\\neq\\varnothing\\land u_j\\in\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{k\\in N}S_k})\\bigr)\\land i\\in N\\land s_i\\in S_i\\land\\forall t_i\\in S_i\\;\\forall\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}S_j\\;\\Bigl(u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The non-strict inequality defines a weakly dominant strategy: it performs at least as well against every fixed opponents' profile.</li>\n<li>Each payoff is applied to the full strategy profile obtained by extending the opponents' profile at coordinate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>; the former two-argument shorthand was not an element of the declared product domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-game.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"S_j=S(j)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=u(i)","display":false},{"tex":"s_i\\in S_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DominantStrategy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}dominant\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\operatorname{DominantStrategy}(s_i,i,N,S,u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{dom}(S)=N\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=N\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in N\\;(S_j\\neq\\varnothing\\land u_j\\in\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{k\\in N}S_k})\\bigr)\\land i\\in N\\land s_i\\in S_i\\land\\forall t_i\\in S_i\\;\\forall\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}S_j\\;\\Bigl(u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u_i\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1526,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy.md|58-df-zfc-game3-dominant-strategy]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","2a48a890cd9aeba0"]}